    "title": "Gokyo Lakes Trek Itinerary: The Ultimate 12-Day Day-by-Day Guide 2026–2027 | Igloo Himalaya Treks",
    "h1": "Gokyo Lakes Trek Itinerary: The Ultimate 12-Day Day-by-Day Guide",
    "breadcrumbTitle": "Gokyo Lakes Trek Itinerary",
