        "h2": "14. Frequently Asked Questions: Gokyo Lakes Trek Costs & Expenses 2027",
        "content": "\n        <p>Get quick, definitive answers to the most common budgeting questions for the 2027 Gokyo Lakes trekking season.</p>\n      "
