        "h2": "14. Frequently Asked Questions: Gokyo Lakes Trek Difficulty",
        "content": "\n        <p>Get immediate, expert answers to the most common questions regarding physical fitness, trail safety, and difficulty for the Gokyo Lakes trek.</p>\n      "
