        "id": "frequently-asked-questions",
        "h2": "14. Frequently Asked Questions: Best Time to Trek Annapurna Base Camp",
        "content": "\n        <p>Get immediate, expert answers to the most common questions regarding weather, seasons, and timing for the Annapurna Base Camp trek.</p>\n      "
