    "lead": "Budgeting accurately for the Langtang Valley Trek in 2027 ensures a seamless Himalayan adventure without unexpected financial surprises. Renowned as one of Nepal's most budget-friendly and accessible high-altitude treks—primarily because it requires zero expensive domestic flights—Langtang delivers world-class 7,000-meter scenery at a fraction of the cost of Everest Base Camp. Curated by our certified expedition team at Igloo Himalaya Treks, here is the complete, itemized cost guide for 2027.",
    "readingTime": "26 min read",
