      {
        "question": "Can beginners complete the Mardi Himal Trek?",
        "answer": "Yes, beginners with reasonable cardiovascular fitness (capable of hiking 5 to 6 hours daily uphill) can complete Mardi Himal. Choosing a 6 or 7-day itinerary, hiring a porter to carry heavy bags, using trekking poles, and hiking with a licensed guide ensures a safe, successful trek."
      }
