        "answer": "Yes! The Gokyo Lakes & Everest Base Camp via Cho La Pass trek connects both routes in a 16- to 18-day circuit. You visit Gokyo Lakes, climb Gokyo Ri, cross the 5,420-meter Cho La Pass, and continue to Everest Base Camp and Kala Patthar."
