        "answer": "A standard 8- to 10-day all-inclusive guided Annapurna Base Camp trek package costs between $750 and $1,150 USD per person. This covers ACAP and TIMS permits, licensed guide, porter, private 4WD transfers from Pokhara, teahouse lodging, and three daily meals."
