        "question": "How much are the permits for the Annapurna Base Camp trek?",
        "answer": "Foreigners need two permits: the Annapurna Conservation Area Project (ACAP) permit (NPR 3,390 / ~$26 USD) and the TIMS Card (NPR 2,000 / ~$15 USD), totaling approximately $41 USD per person."
