        "answer": "Neither is universally better. Poon Hill is easier, more comfortable, and more cultural, with a famous sunrise and a maximum altitude of 3,210m. Mardi Himal is higher (4,500m), wilder, and quieter, with continuous ridge views of Machapuchare. Beginners and families usually prefer Poon Hill; fitter hikers seeking an alpine feel prefer Mardi Himal."
