    "slug": "top-10-destinations-in-nepal",
    "title": "Top 10 Destinations in Nepal: The Ultimate Travel & Trekking Guide (2026/2027) | Igloo Himalaya Treks",
    "h1": "Top 10 Destinations in Nepal: The Complete Travel & Trekking Guide",
    "breadcrumbTitle": "Top 10 Destinations in Nepal",
